String class has 13 constructors and 40 methods 
Source	Example
Empty	new String()
String	new String("hello")
Char array	new String(charArray)
Char array with offset/count	new String(charArray, offset, count)
Byte array	new String(byteArray)
Byte array with offset/count	new String(byteArray, offset, length)
Byte array with charset	new String(byteArray, "UTF-8")
Byte array with offset/count + charset	new String(byteArray, offset, length, "UTF-8")
StringBuffer	new String(stringBuffer)
StringBuilder	new String(stringBuilder)
